# Query Cache Synchronization

- Sync TanStack Query cache with Zustand store updates
- Implement cache invalidation strategies
- Use optimistic updates for better UX
- Handle cache conflicts and resolution
- Maintain data consistency across stores and queries

```typescript
const useSyncStore = create<SyncState>()((set, get) => ({
  updateUser: async (userId, updates) => {
    // Optimistic update in Zustand
    set((state) => ({
      users: state.users.map((u) =>
        u.id === userId ? { ...u, ...updates } : u
      ),
    }));

    // Sync with TanStack Query cache
    queryClient.setQueryData(["user", userId], updates);
  },
}));
```
